# PowerShell rules

- Preserve Windows PowerShell 5.1 compatibility unless the owning profile explicitly defines another runtime.
- Keep Audit, Validate and Report strictly read-only.
- Never run Apply/Restore on the agent host.
- Detect cmdlet and parameter availability and fail before mutation when a required precondition is not met.
- Preserve ownership and exact prior state; do not remove foreign firewall rules.
- Add safe Pester regression tests. Validate using the Windows PowerShell 5.1 parser, PSScriptAnalyzer and Pester.
- For any mutation, load `.agents/skills/design-safe-hardening-change/SKILL.md`.
